     "fichier": "vur-voir-fuf.m4a"
    },
    "mos": {
     "texte": "D pa na n le togs bũmb a to ye. La b ka tõe n wilg bũmb ye, yaa sobg bala, vẽenem la lik bala. Fo sã n wa, fo pa yãend bũmb ye.",
